    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis attractive three-bedroom property is ideally situated in the established and popular Shandra Woods estate offering comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation in a convenient residential setting.The property presents an appealing exterior with a neat front garden and driveway, while internally the accommodation is bright, spacious, and well maintained. The main living area has a welcoming feel, featuring attractive timber flooring and a striking feature wall which creates a focal point within the room. The dining area provides excellent space for family meals and entertaining, while the contemporary kitchen offers generous storage and practical workspace. Upstairs there is also the benefit of a fully converted attic with a beautiful spiral staircase for access, ideal for extra storage.Throughout the home, there is good balance of living and dining space, with neutral finished providing a bright and versatile backdrop for any purchaser to make their own.Outside, the property benefits from off-street parking and a front garden, with the established surroundings adding to its appeal.Shandra Woods is a popular residential location, close to Portarlington town centre and within easy reach of local schools, shops, amenities and transport links.All excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families, or those looking for a comfortable home in a convenient location."
      },
